WEBVTT

00:01.304 --> 00:04.905
<i>It seems today that all you see</i>

00:04.906 --> 00:08.187
<i>Is violence in movies and sex on TV</i>

00:08.188 --> 00:11.885
<i>But where are those
good old-fashioned values</i>

00:11.886 --> 00:14.964
<i>On which we used to rely?</i>

00:14.965 --> 00:18.334
<i>Lucky there's a family guy</i>

00:18.335 --> 00:21.607
<i>Lucky there's a man
who positively can do</i>

00:21.608 --> 00:23.268
<i>All the things that make us</i>

00:23.269 --> 00:24.808
<i>Laugh and cry</i>

00:24.809 --> 00:30.380
<i>He's... a... Fam... ily... Guy!</i>

00:35.291 --> 00:37.039
Hey, you guys ever check Zillow?

00:37.040 --> 00:38.707
Joe, why don't you shut the...

00:38.708 --> 00:41.243
Tell me more about this silly word.

00:41.244 --> 00:43.245
It's this website, Zillow.com.

00:43.246 --> 00:45.447
You plug in your address,
and it gives you an estimate

00:45.448 --> 00:46.782
